    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 1.7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ða Godes ðeowas þe ða sceattas underfoð, þe we Gode syllað, libban clænan life, þæt hy ðurh ða clænnysse ús to Gode þingian mægen;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And that the servants of God who receive the dues which we render to Him shall live a pure life, so that, by virtue of their purity, they may intercede for us with God.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þa Godes þeowas, þe þa sceattas underfoð, þe we Gode syllað, libban clænan life, þæt hy þurh þa clænnysse ús to Gode þingian mægen.</ab>
      </div>
